---
/* Block 4: the diagram's rules as four small animated cards. SMIL is used for
   the path morphs because Safari can't animate `d` from CSS. */
---

<ul class="rules" data-reveal>
  <li style="--c:#e32739;--t:#e3273914">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 240 150" aria-hidden="true">
      <path class="ghost" d="M20 118 C60 118 70 70 110 74 C150 78 150 30 220 32" />
      <path class="line" d="M20 118 L64 118 L110 74 L150 74 L192 32 L220 32">
        <animate attributeName="d" dur="6s" repeatCount="indefinite" calcMode="spline" keyTimes="0;.35;.65;1" keySplines=".6 0 .2 1;0 0 1 1;.6 0 .2 1"
          values="M20 118 C45 118 55 96 70 90 C85 84 95 78 110 74 C130 70 140 64 150 58 C165 48 175 40 190 36 C200 33 210 32 220 32;
                  M20 118 C40 118 50 118 64 118 C80 102 95 88 110 74 C123 74 137 74 150 74 C164 60 178 46 192 32 C201 32 211 32 220 32;
                  M20 118 C40 118 50 118 64 118 C80 102 95 88 110 74 C123 74 137 74 150 74 C164 60 178 46 192 32 C201 32 211 32 220 32;
                  M20 118 C45 118 55 96 70 90 C85 84 95 78 110 74 C130 70 140 64 150 58 C165 48 175 40 190 36 C200 33 210 32 220 32" />
      </path>
      <g class="angles"><text x="92" y="116">45°</text><text x="160" y="92">0°</text></g>
    </svg>
    <h3>Every line bends at 45° or 90°.</h3>
    <p>Real streets curve; the diagram doesn’t. Straight runs make it easier to follow a line across the city.</p>
  </li>
  <li style="--c:#317bc8;--t:#317bc814">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 240 150" aria-hidden="true">
      <path class="line" d="M20 75 H220" style="stroke:#317bc8" />
      <path class="line" d="M120 12 V138" style="stroke:#55c14f" />
      <rect class="capsule" x="106" y="61" width="28" height="28" rx="14">
        <animate attributeName="height" dur="4s" repeatCount="indefinite" values="28;28;60;60;28" keyTimes="0;.3;.45;.85;1" />
        <animate attributeName="y" dur="4s" repeatCount="indefinite" values="61;61;45;45;61" keyTimes="0;.3;.45;.85;1" />
      </rect>
    </svg>
    <h3>Interchanges are rings. Long ones are capsules.</h3>
    <p>A white ring with a black outline marks a change of line. When the platforms sit apart, the ring stretches into a capsule.</p>
  </li>
  <li style="--c:#ff6600;--t:#ff660014">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 240 150" aria-hidden="true">
      <path class="line" d="M20 75 H220" style="stroke:#ff6600" />
      {[55, 95, 135, 175].map((x, i) => <path class="tick" d={`M${x} 75 V60`} style={`--i:${i}`} />)}
      <circle class="end" cx="220" cy="75" r="0" />
      <path class="term" d="M220 60 V90" />
    </svg>
    <h3>Stations are ticks. Line ends are bars.</h3>
    <p>A short tick on one side of the line is a station. A bar across the line is where it ends.</p>
  </li>
  <li style="--c:#992f9c;--t:#992f9c14">
    <div class="names" aria-hidden="true"><span lang="ca">Xarxa de Metro</span><span lang="es">Red de Metro</span><span>Metro network</span></div>
    <h3>Three languages, one map.</h3>
    <p>The title and the accessibility note appear in Catalan, Spanish and English, as they do on the network’s official maps.</p>
  </li>
</ul>

<style>
  .rules { list-style:none; padding:0; margin:2.5rem 0 0; display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:1rem; }
  .rules li { background:var(--t); border-radius:20px; padding:1.1rem 1.1rem 1.25rem; border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 25%, transparent); transition:transform .3s cubic-bezier(.3,1.4,.5,1); }
  .rules li:hover { transform:translateY(-4px) rotate(-.6deg); }
  .rules li:nth-child(2):hover { transform:translateY(-4px) rotate(.6deg); }
  [data-armed]:not([data-inview]).rules li { opacity:0; transform:translateY(24px); }
  [data-armed].rules li { transition:opacity .6s, transform .6s cubic-bezier(.3,1.4,.5,1); }
  [data-armed].rules li:nth-child(2) { transition-delay:.1s; }
  [data-armed].rules li:nth-child(3) { transition-delay:.2s; }
  [data-armed].rules li:nth-child(4) { transition-delay:.3s; }
  svg { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; margin-bottom:.75rem; }
  h3 { font-family:var(--campaign); font-weight:600; font-size:1.0625rem; letter-spacing:-.02em; line-height:1.2; margin:0 0 .5rem; }
  p { font-size:.8125rem; line-height:1.45; color:var(--muted); margin:0; }
  .line { fill:none; stroke:var(--c); stroke-width:9; stroke-linecap:round; stroke-linejoin:round; }
  .ghost { fill:none; stroke:var(--c); stroke-width:2; stroke-dasharray:4 6; opacity:.4; }
  .angles text { font-size:13px; font-weight:700; fill:var(--c); font-family:var(--campaign); }
  .capsule { fill:var(--bg); stroke:var(--fg); stroke-width:5; }
  .tick { stroke:#ff6600; stroke-width:6; stroke-linecap:butt; transform-box:fill-box; transform-origin:bottom; animation:tick 4s infinite calc(var(--i) * .25s) both; }
  .term { stroke:#ff6600; stroke-width:7; animation:tick 4s infinite 1.1s both; transform-box:fill-box; transform-origin:center; }
  @keyframes tick { 0%,8% { transform:scaleY(0); } 18%,85% { transform:scaleY(1); } 100% { transform:scaleY(0); } }
  .names { position:relative; aspect-ratio:240/150; width:100%; margin-bottom:.75rem; display:grid; place-items:center; overflow:hidden; }
  .names span { grid-area:1/1; font-weight:700; font-size:clamp(1.1rem,2vw,1.5rem); letter-spacing:-.03em; animation:cycle 7.5s infinite both; opacity:0; }
  .names span:nth-child(2) { animation-delay:2.5s; font-weight:400; }
  .names span:nth-child(3) { animation-delay:5s; font-style:italic; font-weight:400; }
  @keyframes cycle { 0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(60%); } 6%,30% { opacity:1; transform:none; } 36%,100% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(-60%); } }
  @media (max-width:900px) { .rules { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); } }
  @media (max-width:480px) { .rules { grid-template-columns:1fr; } svg { max-height:110px; } .names { aspect-ratio:auto; height:110px; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) {
    .tick, .term { animation:none; }
    .names span { animation:none; opacity:0; }
    .names span:first-child { opacity:1; }
  }
</style>
